{"repositoryId":1416529541,"availability":"available","full":"harshshinde12/revops360","name":"revops360","description":"RevOps360- B2B sales pipeline analytics and revenue forecasting dashboard with contract-enforced ETL in Python and Streamlit.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-13T05:51:10Z","updated":"2026-10-13T11:25:06Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://revops360.streamlit.app/","topics":["data-analytics","etl","plotly","python","revops","sales-forecasting","streamlit"],"demo":"https://revops360.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.603Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.603Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.603Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.603Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sales pipeline analytics and revenue forecasting dashboard built with Python and Streamlit.","RevOps360 is a revenue operations dashboard designed to analyze B2B sales pipelines, evaluate sales team performance, and generate revenue forecasts. It processes CRM opportunity records through a contract-enforced ETL pipeline and surfaces key revenue metrics in an interactive web interface.","The project handles the end-to-end analytics workflow:"],"features":["Validating raw CRM exports against explicit data contracts using Pydantic.","Generating star-schema analytical marts (factopportunity, dimrep, aggmonthly) with idempotent, content-hashed caching.","Forecasting forward revenue by combining stage-weighted open deals with historical trend extrapolation.","Evaluating forecast accuracy through walk-forward backtesting (MAPE and model bias).","Surfacing operational risks such as segment cycle skew and pipeline coverage deficits against targets."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/harshshinde12/revops360/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0e169c52f1ed4668fac5600d60b1c37f3fed151dfe07580af639f9eca097